    "Name": "Corgi CRG-CA",
    "Details": "Weighing in at 10 tons each, the ultralight Corgi Squad makes use of all the weight-saving technology available to the Clans. Each unit mounts a custom 100-rated extralight fusion engine capable of speeds of up to 160km/h and an endo steel frame, saving weight for ten standard heat sinks. The squad's offensive loadout is also fearsome given the individual 'Mech's light weight - collectively the squad operates a standard size clan LB 20-X autocannon, with two additional one-shot ATM-3 launchers available for emergencies. Two tons of reloads for the LB 20-X ensure that the bark is certainly not worse than the bite. Woof woof!\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Corgi Squad</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.08</color></b>",
